 statically verified  100% side-effect-free ( rsw701 ) —including transitive calls

  ui.* ,  wizard.*  &  showcase.*  — declarative win32 wizard ui, taskdialogs & canvas 
 raggiescript v1.0 ships  two complementary native win32 ui layers —both per-monitor v2 dpi aware, dark/light mode adaptive, windows contrast theme ( spi_gethighcontrast ) compliant, and 100% ui automation screen-reader accessible: 

  14 declarative in-window wizard controls ( ui.welcome  ..  ui.readysummary )  rendered inside a single continuous wizard window ( rsscwizarduiengine.hpp ) across all  11  wizardstyle  themes . 
  modal windows 11  taskdialogindirect  & modern  ifileopendialog  prompts ( ui.taskdialog ,  ui.pickfolder , etc.)  for one-step micro-installers and standalone utilities. 

 declarative in-window wizard controls ( 14  controls) 
 inside  wizard { step <stepid> when (<expr>) { ... } } , controls stack cleanly in keyboard tab order with automatic  &  accelerator mnemonics, two-way  bind: ref <param>  synchronization, reactive  when: () => <bool>  dynamic enablement/visibility, and inline  validate: (val) => validation.ok() | validation.error("...")  gating: 
